sequenceDiagram
  participant D as This device
  participant PG as Postgres
  Note over D,PG: A change syncs 800 ms later. A poll also<br/>runs every 60 s, on focus and on reconnect.
  D->>PG: GET rows changed after cursor − 5 s
  PG-->>D: rows, 500 per page
  D->>D: merge: newer lastModified wins
  D->>D: outbox = logbook vs. shadow
  D->>PG: push_records(outbox)
  PG->>PG: upsert only if incoming is newer
  PG-->>D: ok
  D->>D: shadow and cursor move forward
